{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21097","headline":"箭镞 · 元稹","name":"箭镞","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"箭镞本求利，淬砺良甚难。\n砺将何所用，砺以射凶残。\n不砺射不入，不射人不安。\n爲盗即当射，宁问私与官。\n夜射官中盗，中之血阑干。\n带箭君前诉，君王悄不欢。\n顷曾爲盗者，百箭中心攒。\n竞将儿女泪，滴沥助辛酸。\n君王责良帅，此祸谁爲端。\n帅言发硎罪，不使刃稍刓。\n君王不忍杀，逐之如迸丸。\n仍令後来箭，尽可头团团。\n发硎去虽远，砺镞心不阑。\n会射蛟螭尽，舟行无恶澜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21097.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21097","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}